---
// Compact homepage teaser strip linking to /lab/
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-10 border-t border-line">
  <div class="reveal rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-sm hover:border-accent/40 transition-all duration-200">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-5">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent animate-pulse"></span>
            The Lab
          </span>
          <span class="text-muted/40">•</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-muted font-medium">Side Projects &amp; Experiments</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="mt-1 text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">
          I also build things for fun
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted max-w-xl">
          Developer utilities, interactive calculators, browser games, and cultural portals.
        </p>

        <!-- 3 Quick Preview Links -->
        <div class="mt-3.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
          <a
            href="/tools/"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border border-line bg-surface-alt/60 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink hover:border-accent hover:text-accent transition-colors"
          >
            <span>🛠️</span>
            <span>Toolzy</span>
          </a>
          <a
            href="/mathlify/"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border border-line bg-surface-alt/60 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink hover:border-accent hover:text-accent transition-colors"
          >
            <span>⚡</span>
            <span>Mathlify</span>
          </a>
          <a
            href="/games/"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border border-line bg-surface-alt/60 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink hover:border-accent hover:text-accent transition-colors"
          >
            <span>🎮</span>
            <span>Games</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center md:self-center shrink-0">
        <a
          href="/lab/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-ink text-paper px-4 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium hover:bg-ink/90 transition-colors shadow-sm"
        >
          <span>Explore the Lab</span>
          <span>→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
